msgid "ReliefNT 5.3.1"
msgstr "ReliefNT 5.3.1"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"新增 Linux inotify 文件事件接口：实现 inode 监听、按用户配额、完整事件记录、重命名 cookie、队列溢出恢复和可写 "
"sysctl；支持共享打开文件描述、poll/epoll、权限检查及监听对象的删除、卸载生命周期，导出对应 Linux UAPI。"
msgstr ""
"Added Linux inotify file events: inode watches, per-user quotas, complete event records, rename "
"cookies, queue-overflow recovery, and writable sysctls. Supports shared open file descriptions, "
"poll/epoll, permission checks, and deletion/unmount lifecycles of watched objects, with "
"corresponding Linux UAPI exports."

msgid ""
"改进高负载调度与执行路径：合并远端重新调度 IPI，使用各 CPU 本地 LAPIC 抢占和 ACPI PM 公平时间计数，减少延迟 PIT 中断导致的运行时间漏计；无 I/O "
"私有缺页保留完整用户返回检查，文件 I/O 在原有安全边界按工作预算让出。"
msgstr ""
"Improved scheduling and execution under load: coalesced remote reschedule IPIs and used each CPU's"
" local LAPIC preemption and ACPI PM fair-time counters, reducing runtime undercount from delayed "
"PIT interrupts. Private faults without I/O retain complete user-return checks; file I/O yields "
"according to work budgets at existing safe boundaries."

msgid ""
"修正同属主 PRIO_PROCESS 优先级调整权限和 evdev 事件代际处理，使桌面优先级策略、重复输入和等待唤醒符合现行接口语义；不新增实时调度或整个 syscall 的硬实时保证。"
msgstr ""
"Corrected same-owner PRIO_PROCESS priority permissions and evdev event-generation handling, "
"aligning desktop priority policy, repeated input, and wait wakeups with current interface "
"semantics. This adds no real-time scheduling or hard real-time guarantee for entire syscalls."

msgid ""
"优化 SVGA 软件扫描输出：减少分散损伤区域的重复上传，使用适合显存的像素复制，并为经过校验的 SVGA 像素窗口配置 PAT write-"
"combining；设备控制寄存器、FIFO、fence、VT 与 DMA 所有权边界保持受控。"
msgstr ""
"Optimized SVGA software scanout: reduced repeated uploads of scattered damage regions, used video-"
"memory-appropriate pixel copies, and configured PAT write-combining for validated SVGA pixel "
"windows. Device control registers, FIFO, fences, VT, and DMA ownership remain controlled "
"boundaries."

msgid ""
"新增 xHCI USB2/USB3 Hub、多级路由与下游设备热插拔：支持 Hub 端口供电、复位、状态变更和过流处理，USB2 multi-TT Hub 使用 single-TT 模式；TT "
"控制传输、子树移除及控制器模块卸载保留真实设备和在途资源生命周期。"
msgstr ""
"Added xHCI USB2/USB3 Hubs, multilevel routing, and downstream hotplug: Hub port power, reset, "
"status-change, and overcurrent handling. USB2 multi-TT Hubs use single-TT mode. TT control "
"transfers, subtree removal, and controller-module unloading retain real device and in-flight "
"resource lifecycles."

msgid ""
"新增 VFS 正/负名称缓存：只缓存成功与 ENOENT，按已审计文件系统的变更代际和设备写入代际校验；直接块写入同时失效原生文件系统缓存，设备撤销后恢复实时查询，权限仍逐次检查。缓存采用 512"
" KiB 分配载荷预算及 LRU，不固定 inode、挂载或模块引用；有界回收不会饿死文件页与 swap 回收。"
msgstr ""
"Added VFS positive/negative name caching, caching only success and ENOENT and validating audited "
"filesystem mutation generations and device-write generations. Direct block writes also invalidate "
"native filesystem caches; device revocation restores live queries, and permissions are checked "
"every time. The cache uses a 512 KiB allocation-payload budget and LRU, without pinning inodes, "
"mounts, or modules. Bounded reclaim does not starve file-page or swap reclaim."

msgid "补充 inotify、调度、PAT、xHCI Hub 和名称缓存的原生探针、宿主回归与文档；修复独立版本检查遗漏 VFS 缓存链接对象的问题，以及缓存文档的标题格式。"
msgstr ""
"Added native probes, host regressions, and documentation for inotify, scheduling, PAT, xHCI Hubs, "
"and name caching. Fixed the standalone version check's missing VFS cache link objects and cache-"
"document heading formatting."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking Changes"

msgid ""
"**是，仅涉及内核内部 ABI 和模块配套。** 内部 VFS、文件系统与块设备接口有扩展，旧 .ko 和 prepared SDK 必须随新内核重新构建；不改变已有用户态 syscall "
"编号或磁盘文件系统格式。新增 inotify 是 Linux 接口扩展，不属于 POSIX 接口。"
msgstr ""
"**Yes, limited to internal kernel ABI and matching modules.** Internal VFS, filesystem, and block "
"interfaces expanded; old .ko files and prepared SDKs must be rebuilt with the new kernel. Existing"
" userspace syscall numbers and disk filesystem formats are unchanged. New inotify is a Linux "
"interface extension, not a POSIX interface."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and Migration Notes"

msgid ""
"本次为**正式源码 Release**，只提供标签及 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附预编译内核、模块或 SDK。使用 v5.3.1 和锁定依赖重新构建；内核、initramfs、模块、符号及 "
"ABI 清单必须配套更新。"
msgstr ""
"This **stable source Release** provides only a tag and GitHub automatic source archives, with no "
"precompiled kernel, modules, or SDK. Rebuild v5.3.1 with pinned dependencies; update kernel, "
"initramfs, modules, symbols, and ABI manifests together."

msgid ""
"旧配置执行 olddefconfig 后核对 y/m/n；defconfig 默认仍将生产部件内置。树外模块需使用本版本对应的 Module.symvers 和 prepared SDK，不忽略 "
"vermagic 或类型 CRC 校验。"
msgstr ""
"Run olddefconfig on old configurations and check y/m/n; defconfig still defaults production "
"components to built-in. Out-of-tree modules require this version's Module.symvers and prepared "
"SDK, without bypassing vermagic or type CRC checks."

msgid "inotify 目录监听不递归；收到 IN_Q_OVERFLOW 必须重新扫描。动态文件系统和未明确声明代际能力的提供者继续实时查询，名称缓存不会代替授权或改变文件句柄身份。"
msgstr ""
"inotify directory watches are nonrecursive; IN_Q_OVERFLOW requires rescanning. Dynamic filesystems"
" and providers without explicitly declared generation capabilities retain live queries. Name "
"caching replaces neither authorization nor file-handle identity."

msgid ""
"xHCI Hub 的 BOT 存储和 boot HID 延续既有设备范围，不包含 UAS、通用 HID 报告解释器、USB 音视频等时传输、USB4 或 Type-C/PD。真实 HS/SS "
"Hub、物理 USB 设备和 10/20 Gb/s 链路尚未完成硬件验证。"
msgstr ""
"xHCI Hub BOT storage and boot HID retain existing device scope, excluding UAS, generic HID report "
"interpretation, USB audio/video isochronous transfers, USB4, and Type-C/PD. Real HS/SS Hubs, "
"physical USB devices, and 10/20 Gb/s links have not completed hardware validation."

msgid ""
"既有功能验证覆盖 QEMU 中的 ext4/tmpfs inotify、编译负载桌面交互、两级 Hub 键鼠和存储、热移除及模块生命周期。名称查询微基准在相同用户态、2 vCPU、1024 MiB"
" 的 QEMU/KVM 下，ext4 现有/缺失名称吞吐约为对照的 1.55/1.67 倍；不代表整体编译提速或其他平台性能承诺。"
msgstr ""
"Existing functional validation covers QEMU ext4/tmpfs inotify, desktop interaction under "
"compilation load, two-level Hub keyboard/mouse and storage, hot removal, and module lifecycles. On"
" QEMU/KVM with identical userspace, 2 vCPUs, and 1024 MiB, name-query microbenchmarks achieved "
"about 1.55/1.67 times the control throughput for existing/missing ext4 names. This implies neither"
" overall compilation speedup nor performance promises on other platforms."

msgid ""
"本次发行检查版本生成、5/3/1 数字宏、后缀处理、procfs 夹具和严格文档构建；没有为本标签重建内核/镜像或重跑全部运行测试。历史单项结果不等于整版复验。**VMware "
"验证未完成**，物理硬件和长期稳定性未完成验收。"
msgstr ""
"Release checks cover version generation, 5/3/1 numeric macros, suffix handling, procfs fixtures, "
"and strict documentation builds. No kernel/images were rebuilt or complete runtime tests rerun for"
" this tag. Historical individual results are not full-release retesting. **VMware validation is "
"incomplete**; physical hardware and long-term stability have not passed acceptance."

msgid ""
"扩展 rootfs 宿主套件仍有一项既有 UTS 夹具编译错误：rootfs_uts_test.c 引用了已移除的 "
"linux_uts_load_hostname。该夹具未在本次发行中修改；不将此项算作通过。"
msgstr ""
"The extended rootfs host suite still has one existing UTS fixture compile error: rootfs_uts_test.c"
" references removed linux_uts_load_hostname. This fixture was not changed for this release and is "
"not counted as passed."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer Notes"

msgid ""
"基础版本为 **5.3.1**，生成数字字段为 **5/3/1**；EXTRAVERSION、LOCALVERSION 和模块 ABI 身份后缀独立生成，完整 release 继续遵守 31 "
"字节限制。"
msgstr ""
"The base version is **5.3.1**, with generated numeric fields **5/3/1**. EXTRAVERSION, "
"LOCALVERSION, and module ABI identity suffixes are generated independently; the full release still"
" has a 31-byte limit."

msgid "新文件事件头通过正式 headers_install 导出，内部名称缓存与块设备代际接口不成为稳定用户态 ABI。按各目录 Kbuild 构建；内核实现、测试与手册继续由本仓持有。"
msgstr ""
"New file-event headers are exported through official headers_install. Internal name-cache and "
"block-device generation interfaces do not become stable userspace ABI. Build through per-directory"
" Kbuild; this repository retains ownership of kernel implementation, tests, and manuals."

msgid "原始 ABI golden 未重生成。定向回归与接口对照不表示完整 Linux/POSIX 认证；调度优先级、软件上传和文件缓存优化也不表示已经完成 VMware 图形或硬实时验收。"
msgstr ""
"Original ABI golden data was not regenerated. Targeted regressions and interface comparisons are "
"not complete Linux/POSIX certification. Scheduling-priority, software-upload, and file-cache "
"optimizations also do not establish completed VMware graphics or hard real-time acceptance."

msgid ""
"更新范围为 5.3.0 版本提交 **3082fb4656d65f99b1d5edab249913276e25bc3e** 之后至本次版本提交；仅记录本仓最终有效更新，不包含 ReliefOS "
"应用、桌面和镜像打包。下一版以本次版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"The update range runs after the 5.3.0 version commit **3082fb4656d65f99b1d5edab249913276e25bc3e** "
"through this version commit. Only final effective updates here are recorded, excluding ReliefOS "
"applications, desktop, and image packaging. The next version starts at this commit."
